      <Parameter Name="Text" Value="Add of the Valformat + SYMlink&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;We had it as the reactor's Ambien&#xD;&#xA;temperature was shared through the SC1000_ AnalogInput so we are getting back&#xD;&#xA;the values and sharing it to the Ambinet temperature Analog Input by the symlink&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;In the NVPP installation the reactor's ambient temperature sensor was not existing&#xD;&#xA;so we used that work aroud" />
